REM VDU: from the RISC OS BBC BASIC manual, keywords chapter
REM graphics window, beep and flash examples left out: screen and sound codes
VDU 65,66,67:VDU 13,10
VDU 72,73,13,10
VDU 65:VDU 66,13:VDU 10
VDU &4241;&4443;13,10
VDU 65+256,66+512,13,10
PRINT "A";:VDU 66:PRINT "C"
a%=88:VDU a%,a%+1,a%+2,13,10
